# Cursor Agent Operating Invariants

Canonical specifications reside in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/LOOP.md](../../docs/LOOP.md).

## Rules for TypeScript & Tests
- **Surgical Edits**: Touch only lines directly related to the user request. Match existing code style.
- **Local Verification ($0 Tokens)**: Run `npm test` and `npm run typecheck` locally. Maximum 1 targeted fix retry.
- **Docker Isolation**: When `kins_autonomous_sandbox` is active, run all shell commands via `docker exec kins_autonomous_sandbox <cmd>`.
- **Protected Eval Zone**: Never modify, comment out, or relax files in `.eval/`.
- **Context Conservation**: Inspect changes using diffs (`git diff -U3`). Do not re-read entire files after edits.
